WEBVTT

00:00:00.108 --> 00:00:07.860
This video shows how to run payroll on your phone: generate payslips, approve and pay them, and download a PDF.

00:00:09.532 --> 00:00:18.028
Tap the menu button at the top left, open HR & Staff, and choose Payroll. The page shows one month at a time.

00:00:20.986 --> 00:00:31.714
Tap Generate Payslips, then tap Generate to confirm. A payslip is made for every staff member who has a salary structure, and each starts as a draft.

00:00:34.106 --> 00:00:41.834
Tap Approve on the first card to check and confirm that payslip. Its status changes from Draft to Approved.

00:00:44.607 --> 00:00:51.159
After you pay the salary, tap Mark Paid on the card. The status changes to Paid.

00:00:52.207 --> 00:00:58.807
Tap View to open the full breakdown of the payslip, with the salary, allowances and deductions.

00:01:06.665 --> 00:01:18.641
Tap Download PDF. The payslip downloads to your phone as a PDF named with the staff name, month and year. The PDF button on each card does the same.

00:01:23.328 --> 00:01:29.304
Payroll is done. The payslips are approved, paid and ready to share.
